{"unit_id":"Adamaik__dsh-progress-rules#card-zh","repo":"Adamaik/dsh-progress-rules","commit":"bcfa76af2f3571817e666b57c726d2dc03c8a53a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-progress-rules**（DSH 插件，适用于 DSH profile）：为 agent 提供持续过程规则，并在连续沉默步骤后提醒其汇报。它注册系统提示词 section，并监听 `agent/pre-step` 检查最近 assistant 消息是否含正文。达到 `everySteps` 阈值时追加 user-role context 提醒，有正文后重置计数。适合希望长任务中 agent 持续报告进度的用户。安装 npm 包并加入 profile bundle；无需 API key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:49-68","index.mjs:75-123","cordis.patch.yml:10-22"]}
